{"id":"wb-1-96","name":"广胜寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广胜寺","text":"广胜寺位于山西省临汾市洪洞县县城东北17公里霍山上下，是一座著名佛教寺院。著名佛教大藏经赵城金藏就是出自广胜寺，1961年广胜寺被列入第一批全国重点文物保护单位。\n广胜寺由广胜上寺、广胜下寺及水神庙三组古建筑组成，雄踞山顶的称上寺；坐落山脚，面临霍泉的为下寺；下寺西侧为水神庙。下寺的建筑基本上都是元代修建的，上寺则大部分经明代重建。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E8%83%9C%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94258860,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94258860","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fdc1a7f9ca97daa412c0586b.jpg","title":"广胜寺_03.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%BF%E8%83%9C%E5%AF%BA_03.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/%E5%B9%BF%E8%83%9C%E5%AF%BA_03.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Artsxiang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"","width":320,"height":213}}